        "content": "## TechBase ingest traces\n\nExport spans with `OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=http://127.0.0.1:4318` on FastAPI and the Next ingest worker.\n\nLook for services **`techbase-ingestion`** and **`techbase-web-ingest`**, spans `ingest.enqueue` → `ingest.run` → `ingest.job` → `ingest.{stage}`.\n\nAttribute filter: `tb.job_id`, `tb.outcome`, `tb.stage`.",
